<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>QUBIX - Marketplace</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f3f5f9;color:#172033}
header{background:#101c35;color:white;padding:20px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#42d6b0}
button{border:0;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.publish{background:#42d6b0;color:#102038}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:55px 15px;background:#182b4c;color:white}
.hero h1{font-size:38px;margin:0 0 15px}
.search{display:flex;max-width:600px;margin:25px auto 0;background:white;padding:7px;border-radius:10px}
.search input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;padding:12px;font-size:16px;outline:none}
.search button{background:#42d6b0}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 18px}
h2{margin-bottom:20px}
.categories{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:15px}
.category{background:white;padding:24px 10px;text-align:center;border-radius:12px;font-weight:bold;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #0000000a}
.category span{display:block;font-size:30px;margin-bottom:10px}
.info{background:white;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;margin-top:35px;text-align:center}
footer{text-align:center;background:#101c35;color:white;padding:25px;margin-top:45px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">QUBIX</div>
<button class="publish" onclick="alert('În curând vei putea publica anunțuri!')">+ Publică anunț</button>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<h1>Tot ce cauți, într-un singur loc.</h1>
<p>Cumpără și vinde simplu, rapid și sigur.</p>
<div class="search">
<input type="search" placeholder="Ce cauți astăzi?">
<button>Caută</button>
</div>
</section>

<main>
<h2>Explorează categoriile</h2>
<div class="categories">
<div class="category"><span>🚗</span>Auto</div>
<div class="category"><span>🏠</span>Imobiliare</div>
<div class="category"><span>📱</span>Electronice</div>
<div class="category"><span>🛋️</span>Mobilă</div>
<div class="category"><span>👕</span>Modă</div>
<div class="category"><span>🔧</span>Servicii</div>
<div class="category"><span>⚽</span>Sport</div>
<div class="category"><span>📦</span>Altele</div>
</div>

<div class="info">
<h2>Bine ai venit pe QUBIX!</h2>
<p>Platforma internațională unde oamenii cumpără și vând produse.</p>
<p>Un anunț gratuit pentru fiecare utilizator.</p>
</div>
</main>

<footer>© 2026 QUBIX – Marketplace internațional</footer>
</body>
</html>
